{"subtitle":"","author":"子戈","category":"专栏 · 看片指南","collection":"","publishedAt":"2023-11-01T18:30","status":"published","cover":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-001.jpg","festival":"","partnership":false,"id":"img-8986","title":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了","archiveCategory":"guide","blocks":[{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 1","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-001.jpg","imageText":""},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 2","caption":"","width":75,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-002.jpg","imageText":"11月院线看片指南口口D"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 3","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-003.jpg","imageText":"最为期待 —2部\nOur Aspiration!"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 4","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-004.jpg","imageText":"《涉过愤怒的海》 涉过\n資悠海\n8.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：11月25日1第4个周六出品方：宸铭影业/导演：曹保平预计：豆瓣分7.0-8.0/票房5-10亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点√久违了，曹保平。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"被雪藏四年后，《涉过愤慈的海》终于要登陆大银幕。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这又是一个和《坚如磐石》类似的故事。因为尺度问题，审查受阻，一等再等。希望最终结果，不要像《坚如磐石》那么支离破碎。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本片原本和2015年的《烈日灼心》同属于“灼心三部曲”，而另一部2017年就开机的《她杀》，则因为主演范冰冰“出事儿”，还需时日。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"从《光荣的愤怒》到《涉过愤怒的海》，曹保平算是抓住了过去二十年中国人的潜在心理。问题是，这愤的海，如何能涉过？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 5","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-005.jpg","imageText":"《红毯先生》\nIGWEEMBEROR\n月V日全国十时\n7.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：11月17日1第3个周五出品方：欢十喜文化/导演：宁浩预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5/票房2-5亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点²宁浩新作，这次不是监制。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"《无人区》之后，宁浩已很少拍片，慢慢转型幕后，做他的大娱乐家。这次重新出山，携手刘大，带来这部讽刺喜剧。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"刘大王现在产然已成了某种符号。先是被士宝强在《新喜剧之王》里，大肆模仿，戏一，这次又在《红毯先生》中，成为反讽文娱圈乱象的一个典型人物。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"丝毫不怀疑宁浩的讽刺能力。但从前期口碑看，反响很一般。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"而另一个让人感叹的现象是，近些年所谓讽刺喜剧，往往只敢向文娱圈开火。也对，当遍地都是雷区，炮口也只能朝向自己。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"值得关注一一6部t'sNoteworthy","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 6","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-006.jpg","imageText":"《无价之宝》\n7.0\n无价之宝\n期待值 2023即将上映"},{"text":"上映日期：11月10日1第2个周五出品方：奔跑的人/导演：张大鹏预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5/票房2-6亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点荒诞喜剧抬头了？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这两个月喜剧片不少。前有《二手杰作》，本月有《红毯先生》和这部《无价之宝》。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这些喜剧都不是林花的路数，而是一种更贴近现实的讽刺喜剧或荒诞喜剧。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"具实生活处处都是荒诞，但因为不够极致，所以被大家默默接受。而这类喜剧就是要把荒诞的处境推到极致，让大家一眼辨认，哈哈天笑，再反观自身。喜剧，是最透彻的艺术。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"自然，评价这类喜剧的要义，就是要看它能否把一种司空见惯的小荒诞，放大成触目惊心的大荒诞。看《无价之宝》，请作如是观。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 7","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-007.jpg","imageText":"《红猪》\n7.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：11月17日1第3个周五出品方：吉卜力/导演：宫崎骏","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"豆瓣分8.6（截至发）/预计票房2000-5000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点√宫崎骏，就是那只猪？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"今年六一档，《天空之城》重映，卖了1.35亿。宫崎骏的号召力不减。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这次《红猪》重映，名头不如前者，但大银幕观看的机会，相信很多人不会放过。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"还是照例请出押井守导演的毒舌评点（大意）：这就是一部宫老的私电影，他把自己喜欢的元素一股脑儿全塞进了电影里。所以不用怀疑，“那只猪就是宫老本人。”","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 8","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-008.jpg","imageText":"《追缉》\n11月11日触目惊心\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：11月11日1第2个周六出品方：兴扬电影/导演：曾英庭预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0/票房3000万-1亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点口又一起连环杀人案。删减说明√本片的金马影展版为128分钟台湾公映版为104分钟，目前豆瓣显示的大陆公映版105分钟（也可能是片头片尾所致），具体删减情况未知。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"一起针对外来劳工的连环杀人案，一个痛失爱人的颓废女警探，一段真相不断遭到质疑的反转之旅。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"近年来，台湾正在经历一个类型片的小阳春，尤其以恐怖片和悬疑片为首。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"仍记得多年前《缉魂》上映时，遭遇删减大法，增删改替裁P，无所不用其极，堪称《删减百科全书》。从时长看，这一部不至如此。可看。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 9","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-009.jpg","imageText":"《星愿》\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：11月24日1第4个周五","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：迪士尼","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"导演：克里斯·巴克&弗恩·维拉桑托恩预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0/票房3000-6000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点迪士尼动画，一百年了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"正值迪士尼动画百年之际，这次登台献礼的是一位黑皮肤的公主。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这似乎是一种遥远的回应。想当年，迪士尼制作的首部动画长片，正是《日雪公主与七个小矮人》，由此开后启一个新纪元。如今，这家公司已成了百年老店，公主肤色的变化，也在显影着时代的变迁。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"据说，这还是一个有关反抗威权的故事。有些主题，仍然没变。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 10","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-010.jpg","imageText":"《惊奇队长2》\n6.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：11月10日1第2个周五出品方：漫威/导演：尼娅·达科斯塔预计：豆瓣分5.5-7.0/票房1-3亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点√漫威宇宙的第33部作品。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"后复联时代，漫威在中国每况愈下。今年上映的4部，加在一起，票房才12亿多，不及《孤注一掷》的三分之一。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"可想而知，这一部也好不到哪去。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"毕竟是洋节，不经中国化，已经过不下去了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 11","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-011.jpg","imageText":"《刀尖》\n6.0\n11月24日\n期待值 深入虎穴近身搏杀"},{"text":"上映日期：11月24日1第4个周五","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：博纳/导演：高群书","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0/票房2000-5000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点√《风声》依旧？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"2009年，高群书的一部《风声》，成了众多影迷心中的主旋律经典。实则放在今天看，不过是一部剧本杀电影，行话叫“家国情怀本”。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"新作《刀尖》同样改编自麦家的小说，同样也是谍战片，博纳出品以及预告片质感，又让人看到《无名》的一点影子。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"不知，能否风声依旧？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 12","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-012.jpg","imageText":"谨慎观着 #——4部\nYou CanSkipIt!"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 13","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-013.jpg","imageText":"《我爸没说的那件事》\n5.0\n我\n11月 期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：11月3日1第1个周五出品方：剧魔影业/导演：泷田洋二郎预计：豆瓣分：6.5-7.5/票房：4000万-1亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点√《入师》原班人马打造。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"整个片子流露出一股浓浓的陈旧的味道，又名，爹味儿。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"讲一对父子经营一家老店，父亲死活不把秘方传给儿子，于是儿子出走，多年后归来才体会到父亲的良苦用心。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"哎呦呦，可别整这出了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 14","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-014.jpg","imageText":"《我本是高山》\n5.0 24\n期待值 迎天改命"},{"text":"上映日期：11月24日1第4个周五出品方：瑞丽市谦海文化/导演：郑大圣&杨瑾预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0/票房1-3亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点海清饰演张桂梅。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"真实人物和电影要分开。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"从预告片看，就是个央视6套感动中国电视纪录片质感。以及，我们又能指望它对人物挖到多深呢？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 15","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-015.jpg","imageText":"《靠近我一点》\n4.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：11月24日1第4个周五出品方：摆渡人/导演：夏永康","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分5.0-6.0／票房800-3000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点春夏、张震，为什么要演这个？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"烂俗爱情喜剧片，从预告片看，比《前任4》还差出去几个《前任3》。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"快去看预告片，很好笑。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"11月院线：失踪的他们回来了 · 配图 16","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8986/fig-016.jpg","imageText":"《普通男女》\n11月3日全国上映\n4.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：11月3日1第1个周五出品方：正夫影业/导演：刘雨霖预计：豆瓣分5.0-6.0/票房500-2000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"都市打拼，新一代年轻人现状，努力奋斗的普通人光看介绍就知道，这片子大概是怎样一种鸡汤腔调。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"年轻人的真实状态，了解吗？敢拍吗？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"编辑/子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"排版/令令奇","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"preface":[{"text":"有越多越多影片开始关注小档期，这是件好事。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"象这个11月，原本夹在国庆档和贺岁档两个热闹的大档期之间，极易遭受冷遇，但从目前排出的片单看，竟然颇有看点。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"一大主题是，几个久违的导演回来了。将近5年没拍片的宁浩，带来了《红毯先生》；7年无新作的曹保平、高群书则带来了各自的作品《涉过愤怒的海》和《刀尖》。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"类型片也较为丰富，有荒诞喜剧《无价之宝》，台湾犯罪片《追缉》，以及漫威新作《惊奇队长2》和迪士尼动画《星缘》。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"总之，去影院吧。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"稿主笔 子戈α","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"prefaceOffset":2}